This repository contains the DITA source and build configuration for the
uFTi user documentation.

The documentation is built with the DITA Open Toolkit and the iStandUK
GOV.UK DITA plugin (org.istanduk.gov-uk), both licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Neither is distributed in this repository.

